| 代理选项 | GET /bdrm/proxy/optionselect | [{id, hostPort(masked), status}] | status=available | 必需 |
| 镜像模板选项 | GET /bdrm/imageTemplate/optionselect | [{id, template, imageTag, apiLevel}] | usable=true | 必需 |
| AVD 席位选项 | GET /bdrm/avd/optionselect | [{id, avdName, consolePort}] | accountId | 必需 |
| 节点选项 | GET /bdrm/node/optionselect | [{id, name, status}] | status=ONLINE | 必需 |
| 告警选项 | GET /bdrm/alert/optionselect | [{id, type, level}] | - | 必需 |

